WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.621
Sunshine Coffee Shop was packed.

2
00:00:15.361 --> 00:00:18.203
People sat at tables, drinking coffee and eating baked goods.

3
00:00:19.263 --> 00:00:20.564
A woman stood behind the counter.

4
00:00:20.584 --> 00:00:22.804
"I can help the next customer."

5
00:00:23.925 --> 00:00:25.265
A man stepped up to the counter.

6
00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:27.066
He ordered a cup of tea.

7
00:00:27.086 --> 00:00:30.227
"I'll also have a donut, please."

8
00:00:33.024 --> 00:00:34.705
He sat down and took a bite of his donut.

9
00:00:36.766 --> 00:00:43.830
Suddenly "Yuck!"

10
00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:46.932
Jack looked at the food on his tray and frowned.

11
00:00:47.552 --> 00:00:50.354
"Why did Principal Penn have to change the menu?"

12
00:00:51.674 --> 00:00:52.435
It was lunchtime.

13
00:00:53.195 --> 00:00:55.436
Roxy and her friends were in the school cafeteria.

14
00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:58.398
Today was the first day with the new lunch menu.

15
00:00:59.338 --> 00:01:01.740
The kids' trays were full of vegetables and whole grains.

16
00:01:02.868 --> 00:01:06.891
All of the food was now healthy and organic.

17
00:01:07.491 --> 00:01:08.292
Terrell groaned.

18
00:01:08.312 --> 00:01:11.234
"Why did Principal Penn do this to us?

19
00:01:11.975 --> 00:01:15.457
The old menu was perfect, except for sloppy joes."

20
00:01:15.477 --> 00:01:19.180
"You two are acting silly," Mara said.

21
00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.221
"This food is delicious."

22
00:01:22.422 --> 00:01:24.604
She took a bite of her kale salad and smiled.

23
00:01:25.625 --> 00:01:26.385
She ate some more.

24
00:01:28.347 --> 00:01:30.088
Terrell looked at his food suspiciously.

25
00:01:31.052 --> 00:01:33.454
He stuck his fork into a small cube and held it up.

26
00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:35.675
"What is this thing?"

27
00:01:36.956 --> 00:01:39.037
"It's tofu," Mara said.

28
00:01:39.057 --> 00:01:41.338
"It's made from soybeans.

29
00:01:41.838 --> 00:01:42.619
It's good.

30
00:01:43.059 --> 00:01:43.960
You should try it."

31
00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:46.081
Terrell wrinkled his nose.

32
00:01:47.442 --> 00:01:48.442
"No, thanks!"

33
00:01:49.723 --> 00:01:51.124
The tofu fell off his fork.

34
00:01:52.104 --> 00:01:54.166
It bounced off the table and landed on the floor.

35
00:01:55.707 --> 00:01:57.628
A kid walking by stepped on the tofu.

36
00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:01.202
It was now flat and mushy, with bits of dirt on it.

37
00:02:02.323 --> 00:02:03.485
Jack and Terrell laughed.

38
00:02:04.966 --> 00:02:08.289
"I like the new menu," Roxy said.

39
00:02:08.309 --> 00:02:11.972
"Also, this isn't the only thing Principal Penn changed.

40
00:02:13.093 --> 00:02:14.895
She wants everyone to be healthier.

41
00:02:15.475 --> 00:02:17.937
So she added ten more minutes to recess."

42
00:02:19.078 --> 00:02:20.860
"Now that is a good change!"

43
00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:21.701
Jack said.

44
00:02:21.721 --> 00:02:25.244
"Yeah, but Terrell sighed.

45
00:02:25.936 --> 00:02:29.439
"I wish Rocket Girl would save us from this kale and tofu."

46
00:02:30.239 --> 00:02:31.260
Roxy rolled her eyes.

47
00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:35.303
"Rocket Girl has more important things to do, Terrell.

48
00:02:36.023 --> 00:02:39.345
And besides, maybe Rocket Girl actually likes this kind of food."

49
00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:42.087
Terrell gave Roxy a sly look.

50
00:02:42.708 --> 00:02:43.368
"She does?

51
00:02:44.069 --> 00:02:44.989
How do you know?"

52
00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:46.490
Roxy froze.

53
00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:50.333
"Um Just then her watch beeped.

54
00:02:50.353 --> 00:02:54.656
"I'll be right back," Roxy told her friends.

55
00:02:57.108 --> 00:02:59.169
She went into the hallway and flipped the watch open.

56
00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.031
Mayor Bloom looked scared.

57
00:03:03.051 --> 00:03:04.832
"What's wrong, Mayor?"

58
00:03:05.152 --> 00:03:05.872
Roxy asked.

59
00:03:06.813 --> 00:03:07.453
"Rocket Girl!

60
00:03:07.973 --> 00:03:10.355
Something terrible is happening," Mayor Bloom said.

61
00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:13.076
"Hungry zombies are invading Metro City!

62
00:03:13.776 --> 00:03:17.138
There's a crowd of them at Sunshine Coffee Shop!"

63
00:03:17.198 --> 00:03:17.958
Roxy gulped.

64
00:03:17.978 --> 00:03:19.619
"Don't worry, Mayor.

65
00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:21.120
I'm on my way!"
